  "body": [
    "Welcome to a glimpse of luxury on wheels, designed with our fantastic client and her adorable Yorkie in mind. Crafted from a brand-new Mercedes Sprinter 170 Wheel Base, this custom campervan is an embodiment of opulence, functionality, and timeless aesthetics.",
    "Falling under our El Capitan Tier, this van doesn't compromise on comfort or efficiency. It comes equipped with 400 watts of solar power, 500 amp hours of lithium batteries, and a 40-gallon freshwater tank. For those hot summer days, a Dometic AC unit ensures a cool and serene environment.",
    "We've taken care of the little things too. There's a cozy, secure cage for the puppy tucked away under the front seat, ensuring our furry friend enjoys the ride just as much. For entertainment and relaxation, a mounted smart TV is at your disposal, and culinary enthusiasts will appreciate the slide-out spice rack in the cabinets.",
    "Van Conversion Build TiersThe van's design is a blend of sleek black and white, a timeless look that guarantees style on every journey. This beautiful campervan is more than ready to accompany our client on her adventures across the country."
  ],
